sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor MarginEngine as RMS / Margin Engine
    participant KafkaCrit as Kafka: notification-critical
    participant Consumer as Dedicated High-Priority Consumer
    participant Enrichment as User Enrichment Service
    participant DndService as TRAI DND Compliance Service
    participant FreqCap as Redis Atomic Frequency Cap Service
    participant Router as Regulatory Multi-Channel Router
    participant Templates as Multi-Lingual Template Engine
    participant RabbitMQ as RabbitMQ Priority Queue (Critical)
    participant Worker as SMS & Push Delivery Workers
    participant Providers as Provider Cluster (MSG91 / Twilio / FCM)
    participant Analytics as Prometheus & Real-Time Analytics

    MarginEngine->>KafkaCrit: Publish RISK-001 (CorrelationId, IdempotencyKey)
    KafkaCrit->>Consumer: Poll with manual offset commit
    Consumer->>Enrichment: Enrich User Context (Phone, Email, KYC, Segment)
    Consumer->>Router: Priority 1 - Regulatory Mandate Assessment
    Note over Router: Regulatory Directive: Margin calls MUST dispatch via SMS, Email, Push
    Consumer->>FreqCap: Check Frequency Cap
    Note over FreqCap: CRITICAL_BYPASS: Mandatory margin call never blocked
    Consumer->>Templates: Render Personalized Template (Hindi/English fallback, currency formatting)
    Consumer->>RabbitMQ: Enqueue to notifications.priority.critical
    RabbitMQ->>Worker: Consume high-priority task
    Worker->>DndService: Immediate Pre-Dispatch DND Verification
    Note over DndService: TRAI UCC Regulation 2018 Statutory Exemption (REGULATORY_BYPASS)
    Worker->>Providers: Dispatch SMS to MSG91 Sandbox
    alt MSG91 Responds OK (<100ms)
        Providers-->>Worker: Delivery Receipt (External ID)
    else MSG91 Fails / Gateway Timeout
        Worker->>Providers: Autonomous Failover to Secondary Twilio SMS
        Providers-->>Worker: Twilio Accepted (HTTP 201)
    end
    Worker->>Analytics: Record Delivery, Cost & Latency (P99 < 10s SEBI Target)
    Worker->>KafkaCrit: Commit manual offset
